      "end_ms": 329429,
      "text": "说这种话的人"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 127,
      "start_ms": 329429,
      "end_ms": 332909,
      "text": "就觉得市民社会道德已经跑在法律前面的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 128,
      "start_ms": 332909,
      "end_ms": 334709,
      "text": "这种话是非常有问题的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 129,
      "start_ms": 334709,
      "end_ms": 335549,
      "text": "no no no no no"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 130,
      "start_ms": 335549,
      "end_ms": 336800,
      "text": "你真不要以为"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 131,
      "start_ms": 337219,
      "end_ms": 337879,
      "text": "真"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 132,
      "start_ms": 337879,
      "end_ms": 340339,
      "text": "不要以为你们这些市民社会"
    },
